  "readmeFile": "ReadMe.md",
  "releaseNotes": "### 6.2.496\nBreakingChange: Sets the Default TwinCAT.Ads.Server.AdsSymbolicServer.InstancePathEncoding to UTF8 (Aligned to the TwinCAT 4026 Default)\n### 6.2.329\nFix: DeviceInvalidSize when reading SymbolVersion (IG: 0xF008) with 1 byte read size (#239950 ,https://github.com/Beckhoff/TF6000_ADS_DOTNET_V5_Samples/issues/70)\n### 6.2.266\nBreakingChange: TwinCAT.Ads.Server.BaseTickTrigger is now specified as 'internal' instead of 'public'. It's not necessary anmore to instantiate the Trigger by sample code. Just set the \nnew AdsSymbolServer.BaseTick property, if the default BaseTick should be changed.\nFix: AdsSymbolicServer time calculation for notifications does not work correctly, #227193\nEnh: Adding AdsSymbolicServer.BaseTick property to change the Notification resolution.\n### 6.2.263\nBreakingChange: TwinCAT.Ads.Server.BaseTickTrigger is now specified as 'internal' instead of 'public'. It's not necessary anmore to instantiate the Trigger by sample code. Just set the \nnew AdsSymbolServer.BaseTick propert, if the default BaseTick should be changed.\nEnh: Adding AdsSymbolicServer.BaseTick property to change the Notification resolution.\n### 6.2\nEnh: Implementation of AdsOverMqtt channel (by usage of Beckhoff.TwinCAT.AdsOverMqtt package)\nEnh: Support of Unix File Sockets instead of Loopback TCP\nEnh: Support of .NET configuration providers in AdsClient/AdsServer/AdsRouter (Package Beckhoff.TwinCAT.Ads.ConfigurationProviders)\nEnh: Implementation of specific ADS/Ams logging providers (Package Beckhoff.TwinCAT.Ads.ConfigurationProviders)\nEnh: TargetFramework dependencies changed to net8.0, net6.0, netstandard2.0\nEnh: Implementation of AdsTransMode.Cyclic for Notifications in Beckhoff.TwinCAT.Ads.SymbolicServer package,#220776\nEnh: Implementation of AdsOverMqtt channel (by usage of Beckhoff.TwinCAT.AdsOverMqtt package)\nEnh: Support of Unix File Sockets instead of Loopback TCP\nEnh: Support of .NET configuration providers in AdsClient/AdsServer/AdsRouter (Package Beckhoff.TwinCAT.Ads.ConfigurationProviders)\nEnh: Implementation of specific ADS/Ams logging providers (Package Beckhoff.TwinCAT.Ads.ConfigurationProviders)\nEnh: TargetFramework dependencies changed to net8.0, net6.0, netstandard2.0\nBreakingChange: Replacing ILogger parameter in constructors (AdsSession,AdsClient,AdsServer,AmsTcpIpRouter) by ILoggerFactory to enable more flexible category based logging.",
